2026-05-03 10:15:36 [deepseek-v4] Additional note
2026-05-03 10:15:36 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-05-03 10:15:36 [deepseek-v4] Deno does not limit a process to one `accept` overall – it limits one `accept()` per
2026-05-03 10:15:36 [deepseek-v4] listener object. By creating two listeners, you can accept on both ports simultaneously. This is
2026-05-03 10:15:36 [deepseek-v4] exactly how you'd handle multiple services in a single process.
