2026-05-03 13:06:04 [deepseek-v4] Step 4 – Modify the `slopPrompt` loop to race all accept promises
2026-05-03 13:06:04 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-05-03 13:06:04 [deepseek-v4] In `slopPrompt`, replace the hardcoded three-race with:
2026-05-03 13:06:04 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-05-03 13:06:04 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-05-03 13:06:04 [deepseek-v4] // Inside the loop, before building race:
2026-05-03 13:06:04 [deepseek-v4] const acceptPromises: Promise<{ connection: Deno.TcpConn; name: string; port: number }>[] = [];
2026-05-03 13:06:04 [deepseek-v4] for (const entry of listenerRegistry.values()) {
2026-05-03 13:06:04 [deepseek-v4] 	acceptPromises.push(entry.acceptPromise);
2026-05-03 13:06:04 [deepseek-v4] }
