2026-05-03 13:06:04 [deepseek-v4] Why this is modular
2026-05-03 13:06:04 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-05-03 13:06:04 [deepseek-v4] - Adding a new bot: call `startListener("botname", 8085)` anywhere (e.g., in your bot's init).
2026-05-03 13:06:04 [deepseek-v4] - No need to modify `slopPrompt` internals – it automatically picks up new entries from
