2026-05-03 13:44:03 [deepseek-v4] call it "unsafe typescript". The system prompt guidelines you follow (tabs, named functions, avoid
2026-05-03 13:44:03 [deepseek-v4] patronising) are consistent with the comments in the code.
2026-05-03 13:44:03 [deepseek-v4] 
