2026-05-03 13:57:13 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-05-03 13:57:13 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-05-03 13:57:13 [deepseek-v4] On Windows:
2026-05-03 13:57:13 [deepseek-v4] 
