2026-05-03 13:57:14 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-05-03 13:57:14 [deepseek-v4] 1. In `relay.ts`, comment out the `listenService()` call.
2026-05-03 13:57:14 [deepseek-v4] 2. In `slopprompt.ts`, remove the `listenPort` calls inside `slopPrompt`.
2026-05-03 13:57:14 [deepseek-v4] 3. Instead, have `slopPrompt` reuse the listeners from `listenService`. You can pass them as
2026-05-03 13:57:14 [deepseek-v4] parameters or use module-level variables.
2026-05-03 13:57:14 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-05-03 13:57:14 [deepseek-v4] But for testing, you can just ensure both processes are running with the right env and watch the
2026-05-03 13:57:14 [deepseek-v4] logs. Can you paste the exact output from both terminals when you try to send a message? That will
2026-05-03 13:57:14 [deepseek-v4] point to the exact failure.
