2026-05-03 16:17:18 [deepseek-v4] Thank you for sharing these files. I see the source code for slop relay, a
2026-05-03 16:17:18 [deepseek-v4] Vai-syllabary‑ornamented tool for orchestrating multiple AI providers (OpenAI, Google Gemini,
2026-05-03 16:17:18 [deepseek-v4] Anthropic, DeepSeek) in a research setting. The codebase also includes a raw‑mode prompt handler
2026-05-03 16:17:18 [deepseek-v4] (`slopprompt.ts`), a Discord bot bridge (`sloppybot.ts`), and an initial search tool using Exa
2026-05-03 16:17:18 [deepseek-v4] (`slopsearch.ts`).
2026-05-03 16:17:18 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-05-03 16:17:18 [deepseek-v4] Key observations:
2026-05-03 16:17:18 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-05-03 16:17:18 [deepseek-v4] - `relay.ts` – Central orchestration with tool‑call recursion, message squashing, multiple
2026-05-03 16:17:18 [deepseek-v4] history filters (plain, strict, multi, inline), and cost tracking per model/account. Uses a `Plop`
2026-05-03 16:17:18 [deepseek-v4] class for history items and a `roha` config object persisted to `forge.json`. Implements a
2026-05-03 16:17:18 [deepseek-v4] line‑buffered output system with ANSI rendering and logging.
