2026-05-03 16:17:18 [deepseek-v4] expansion (`:heart:→❤`), and a Promise‑racing loop to accept incoming TCP connections (ports
2026-05-03 16:17:18 [deepseek-v4] 8081–8083) alongside user input.
2026-05-03 16:17:18 [deepseek-v4] - `sloppybot.ts` – Discord.js client that forwards messages from a fountain channel to the
