2026-05-03 16:18:05 [deepseek-v4] 2. Accept all ports with one function
2026-05-03 16:18:05 [deepseek-v4] Replace `acceptThread()` with a single `async function acceptConnections()` that races accepts on
2026-05-03 16:18:05 [deepseek-v4] all three listeners:
