2026-05-03 16:18:05 [deepseek-v4] 3. Add a short initial handshake
2026-05-03 16:18:05 [deepseek-v4] Require each connecting bot to send a JSON frame identifying itself (e.g.,
2026-05-03 16:18:05 [deepseek-v4] `{"type":"bot","name":"sloppy"}`) before accepting regular messages.
