2026-05-04 08:14:05 [deepseek-v4] but if a connection closes right after `accept`, the promise may never resolve. Adding a timeout or
2026-05-04 08:14:05 [deepseek-v4] cleanup could help.
2026-05-04 08:14:05 [deepseek-v4] - Memory – `rxBuffer` of 1 MB per connection is fine, but multiple bots could add up.
