2026-05-07 11:21:54 [deepseek-v4] - Reduce verbosity in bot logging (make it configurable).
2026-05-07 11:21:54 [deepseek-v4] - Clean up the duplicate broadcast of model replies.
2026-05-07 11:21:54 [deepseek-v4] - Reconsider the race conditions in the raw‑mode prompt reader.
2026-05-07 11:21:54 [deepseek-v4] - Consider using an external unicode width library.
2026-05-07 11:21:54 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-05-07 11:21:54 [deepseek-v4] Overall, it’s a solid foundation for testing and comparing many LLMs side‑by‑side.
