2026-05-07 11:38:12 [deepseek-v4] The provided files describe Slop Relay (v1.8.2), a multi‑user, multi‑model research tool
2026-05-07 11:38:12 [deepseek-v4] for interacting with large language models. It supports multiple backends (DeepSeek, OpenAI,
2026-05-07 11:38:12 [deepseek-v4] Anthropic, Google, Moonshot, xAI, etc.) via SDKs or custom API wrappers, and includes a CLI prompt,
2026-05-07 11:38:12 [deepseek-v4] file sharing, tool (function) calling, speech synthesis, Discord bot integration, and logging with
2026-05-07 11:38:12 [deepseek-v4] a custom hexadecimal timestamp format (slopmarks).
