2026-05-07 11:38:12 [deepseek-v4] limit) could be helpful.
2026-05-07 11:38:12 [deepseek-v4]   - The raw‑mode prompt (`slopprompt.ts`) uses a busy‑wait loop with `Promise.race`; a more
