2026-05-07 13:41:13 [deepseek-v4] Overview
2026-05-07 13:41:13 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-05-07 13:41:13 [deepseek-v4] - Clock & line timing: 166.5 MHz → 10656 cycles per PAL line (the exact figure for 576i).
