2026-05-07 15:11:08 [gemini-3.1-lite] The Loop Timing Analysis
2026-05-07 15:11:08 [gemini-3.1-lite] Each `out` instruction takes 1 cycle plus the delay cycles in the brackets.
2026-05-07 15:11:08 [gemini-3.1-lite] • `out pins, 1 [9]` = 10 cycles
