2026-05-07 15:11:08 [gemini-3.1-lite] • `out pins, 1 [8]` = 9 cycles
2026-05-07 15:11:08 [gemini-3.1-lite] • `out pins, 1 [9]` = 10 cycles
2026-05-07 15:11:08 [gemini-3.1-lite] • `out pins, 1 [8]` = 9 cycles
2026-05-07 15:11:08 [gemini-3.1-lite] • `out pins, 1 [8]` = 9 cycles
2026-05-07 15:11:08 [gemini-3.1-lite] • `out pins, 1 [7]` = 8 cycles
