2026-05-07 15:12:46 [gemini-3.1-lite] The Math
2026-05-07 15:12:46 [gemini-3.1-lite] 1.  Target: 2 cycles of 4.43361875\text MHz.
2026-05-07 15:12:46 [gemini-3.1-lite] 2.  Period of 2 cycles: 2 / 4,433,618.75 \approx 451,085 \text ns.
2026-05-07 15:12:46 [gemini-3.1-lite] 3.  PIO Cycles required: At 166.5\text MHz, one cycle is \approx 6.006 \text ns.
2026-05-07 15:12:46 [gemini-3.1-lite] 4.  Target PIO cycles per loop: 451,085 / 6.006 \approx \mathbf75.1 \text cycles.
