2026-05-07 15:36:25 [gemini-3.1-lite] ; Loop: 4 cycles/bit (1 out + 2 delay + 1 jmp) = 1 bit per 90-degree phase
2026-05-07 15:36:25 [gemini-3.1-lite] ; 8 bits from FIFO = 2 full color subcarrier cycles (4 bits per cycle)
