2026-05-07 18:13:08 [gemini-3.1-lite] The use of `noinlinenotinflash_func` for `ReadBootSel` is best practice for
2026-05-07 18:13:08 [gemini-3.1-lite] RP2350, as it ensures the code is running from SRAM, preventing XIP (Execute In Place) latency
2026-05-07 18:13:08 [gemini-3.1-lite] during the critical QSPI pin-toggle window.
