2026-05-07 19:09:08 [deepseek-v4] word 1 will be part of the back porch before the burst starts. That is acceptable – it will output
2026-05-07 19:09:08 [deepseek-v4] a short zero (black) interval before the burst begins, which matches PAL specification (a small
