2026-05-07 19:22:30 [deepseek-v4] 1. Add one `[2]` delay in `chroma.pio` loop.
2026-05-07 19:22:30 [deepseek-v4] 2. Change `burst = 0x2B2B2B2B` for even and `0x1E1E1E1E` for odd.
2026-05-07 19:22:30 [deepseek-v4] 3. Reduce `colorWords` to `64`, set count = `1023`, and set ring size to `9`.
2026-05-07 19:22:30 [deepseek-v4] 4. In `vid_field()`, restart the chroma DMA at the appropriate half of the array.
