2026-05-08 07:49:29 [gemini-3.1-pro] the lower 16 bits `0x2310` contain exactly two full subcarrier cycles, and the upper 16 bits become
2026-05-08 07:49:29 [gemini-3.1-pro] `0x0000` for blanking).*
