2026-05-08 07:49:29 [gemini-3.1-pro] One Minor Catch
2026-05-08 07:49:29 [gemini-3.1-pro] In your C code for the chroma PIO initialization, you have:
2026-05-08 07:49:29 [gemini-3.1-pro] `smconfigsetoutshift(&config5, true, false, 32);`
2026-05-08 07:49:29 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
