2026-05-08 07:49:29 [gemini-3.1-pro] instruction, if `autopull` is `false`, the state machine will exhaust the OSR and then just shift
2026-05-08 07:49:29 [gemini-3.1-pro] zeroes infinitely instead of fetching the next `colorWord` from the DMA FIFO. I suspect you meant
2026-05-08 07:49:29 [gemini-3.1-pro] to set this to `true` (as you correctly did for `vidbit`).
