2026-05-08 10:33:37 [kimi-k2.6] │  `pio_sm_set_consecutive_pindirs(..., 2, true)`  │  Sets the PIO direction for both pins to **output**. Since your `chroma.pio` never executes `set pindirs`, this must be done from C.  │
