2026-05-08 10:48:09 [kimi-k2.6] carrier must fit inside that window. Your current `colorWords = 128` generates ~115 µs of
2026-05-08 10:48:09 [kimi-k2.6] output, which spills across multiple lines and breaks the colour killer.
