2026-05-11 19:15:26 [gemini-3.1-pro] excellent application of the RP2350's new random-access FIFO capabilities. This effectively turns
2026-05-11 19:15:26 [gemini-3.1-pro] the FIFO into a high-speed lookup table, which is a massive architectural upgrade over the RP2040
2026-05-11 19:15:26 [gemini-3.1-pro] for generating specific pulse trains without consuming instruction memory.
