2026-05-11 19:15:26 [gemini-3.1-pro] instruction references `rxfifo[y]`. Depending on your specific assembler (e.g., pioasm version),
2026-05-11 19:15:26 [gemini-3.1-pro] this might need to be `txfifo[y]` to align with the `txget` directive, or conversely, the directive
