2026-05-13 09:04:39 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
2026-05-13 09:04:39 [gemini-3.1-pro] The `wait` instruction does not support the `clear` modifier. Only the `irq` instruction accepts
2026-05-13 09:04:39 [gemini-3.1-pro] modifiers like `clear` and `wait`.
2026-05-13 09:04:39 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
2026-05-13 09:04:39 [gemini-3.1-pro] To wait for an IRQ and then clear it, you need to use two separate instructions, exactly as you
2026-05-13 09:04:40 [gemini-3.1-pro] correctly did in your `pixelpump.pio` file.
2026-05-13 09:04:40 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
2026-05-13 09:04:40 [gemini-3.1-pro] Here is the corrected snippet for the start of your `colorpump.pio` program:
2026-05-13 09:04:40 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
2026-05-13 09:04:40 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
2026-05-13 09:04:40 [gemini-3.1-pro] 	wait	1 irq 5
2026-05-13 09:04:40 [gemini-3.1-pro] 	irq	clear 5
