2026-05-14 11:15:14 [deepseek-v4] - The stall loop `jmp pin stall` waits while the trigger pin is high (if pin == true). With
2026-05-14 11:15:14 [deepseek-v4] `colorpump` setting the trigger high only for one PIO word cycle, the stall will be short. But
2026-05-14 11:15:14 [deepseek-v4] beware that multiple colourfifo state machines might see the same trigger – they need a shared
2026-05-14 11:15:14 [deepseek-v4] index bus and per‑channel triggers.
