2026-05-14 11:37:14 [deepseek-v4] integration, file sharing, and session management. The codebase is substantial (relay.ts alone is
2026-05-14 11:37:14 [deepseek-v4] 132 kB) and shows careful design for multi‑provider, multi‑user chat.
