2026-05-14 11:37:14 [deepseek-v4] input and a TCP listener for bots, and `slopbot.ts` bridges Discord.
2026-05-14 11:37:14 [deepseek-v4] - The emphasis on Unicode‑aware string width (`stringWidth`, `discordStringWidth`) and the
