2026-05-14 11:37:14 [deepseek-v4] - The command system in `forge.md` includes `/project`, `/share`, `/commit`, `/model`, `/temp`,
2026-05-14 11:37:14 [deepseek-v4] `/config`, and many others — a full research interface.
2026-05-14 11:37:14 [deepseek-v4] - The use of `squashMessages`, `strictHistory`, `multiHistory`, and `inlineHistory` shows careful
2026-05-14 11:37:14 [deepseek-v4] handling of different API message formats (plain, multi‑modal, tool calls).
2026-05-14 11:37:14 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-05-14 11:37:14 [deepseek-v4] If anything is new or different compared to similar tools, it’s the single‑file monolith
