2026-05-14 11:37:14 [deepseek-v4] combined with the slop‑based network protocol that lets remote bots (like Discord) inject
2026-05-14 11:37:14 [deepseek-v4] commands and messages into the same session. The colour index mechanism in the PIO video pipeline
2026-05-14 11:37:14 [deepseek-v4] is also unconventional.
