2026-05-14 12:51:23 [deepseek-v4] Summary
2026-05-14 12:51:23 [deepseek-v4] - You have two clever but separate frameworks. Decide which one to use for the final video mode (or
2026-05-14 12:51:23 [deepseek-v4] combine them with a mux).
2026-05-14 12:51:23 [deepseek-v4] - Pay attention to exact cycle counts – a single cycle error in a 10‑cycle pixel will cause colour
2026-05-14 12:51:23 [deepseek-v4] shift.
2026-05-14 12:51:23 [deepseek-v4] - IRQ sync is delicate: ensure the pixel source state machine knows exactly when to start pushing
2026-05-14 12:51:23 [deepseek-v4] data after the back porch. Use DMA or CPU carefully.
