2026-05-15 11:30:59 [deepseek-v4] While those are less likely to fail (they are loaded first, and space is usually sufficient),
2026-05-15 11:30:59 [deepseek-v4] adopting the same pattern there would make the error‑handling uniform across all PIO
2026-05-15 11:30:59 [deepseek-v4] initializations. For example:
2026-05-15 11:30:59 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-05-15 11:30:59 [deepseek-v4] 
