2026-05-15 12:01:42 [gpt-5.5-2026] A few things stand out as new/different or worth checking:
2026-05-15 12:01:42 [gpt-5.5-2026] 
2026-05-15 12:01:42 [gpt-5.5-2026] Notable new/different bits
2026-05-15 12:01:42 [gpt-5.5-2026] 
2026-05-15 12:01:42 [gpt-5.5-2026] - `colorfifo.pio` / `greyline.pio` now use RP2350-style `.fifo txget` and indexed `rxfifo[y]`
2026-05-15 12:01:42 [gpt-5.5-2026] lookup. That is a nice fit for palette / pulse-train table dispatch if the pin-derived index is
2026-05-15 12:01:42 [gpt-5.5-2026] guaranteed to be clean.
2026-05-15 12:01:42 [gpt-5.5-2026] - `colorpump.pio` now waits on `irq 5`, clears it, then emits a full pixel run using `y` from
2026-05-15 12:01:42 [gpt-5.5-2026] `isr`. The branch timing looks intentionally equalised across the four trigger outputs.
2026-05-15 12:01:42 [gpt-5.5-2026] - `vidbit.pio` now sets `irq 5` before active video, so the colour/grey pumps appear
2026-05-15 12:01:42 [gpt-5.5-2026] line-synchronised from the video timing SM.
