2026-05-15 12:01:42 [gpt-5.5-2026] 
2026-05-15 12:01:42 [gpt-5.5-2026] Main thing I would double-check
2026-05-15 12:01:42 [gpt-5.5-2026] 
2026-05-15 12:01:42 [gpt-5.5-2026] `greyline.pio` waits on `irq 5`, but does not clear it:
