2026-05-15 13:07:37 [claude-haiku-4-5] Key Technical Highlights
2026-05-15 13:07:37 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:07:37 [claude-haiku-4-5] • Video Generation Architecture*
2026-05-15 13:07:37 [claude-haiku-4-5] - RP2350 @ 166.5 MHz generating PAL 576i/progressive video via PIO state machines
2026-05-15 13:07:37 [claude-haiku-4-5] - Clever DMA-fed pipeline: `vidbit.pio` → optional `wst.pio` (teletext) and `chroma.pio` (color
