2026-05-15 13:07:37 [claude-haiku-4-5] - Frame data pre-computed in RAM as pulse-train edge counters rather than raw pixel data
2026-05-15 13:07:37 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:07:37 [claude-haiku-4-5] • Signal Design*
2026-05-15 13:07:37 [claude-haiku-4-5] - PAL timing uses edge-width encoding (sync pulse durations as 32-bit values) rather than
