2026-05-15 13:07:37 [claude-haiku-4-5] - Vsync/Hsync implemented as programmed pulse trains with configurable durations
2026-05-15 13:07:37 [claude-haiku-4-5] - Supports both progressive (288P) and interlaced (576I) modes with separate even/odd frame buffers
2026-05-15 13:07:37 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:07:37 [claude-haiku-4-5] • Color Pipeline* (greyline/colorfifo/colorpump)
2026-05-15 13:07:37 [claude-haiku-4-5] - Indexed color via `colorpump.pio` selecting 1-of-4 pulse trains from `colorfifo.pio`
2026-05-15 13:07:37 [claude-haiku-4-5] - 3-pin tristate output architecture (threepin.pio) for component video
2026-05-15 13:07:37 [claude-haiku-4-5] - PAL color subcarrier at 4× `f_sc` using 2-pin 2-bit DAC
2026-05-15 13:07:37 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:07:37 [claude-haiku-4-5] • Novel Elements*
2026-05-15 13:07:37 [claude-haiku-4-5] - `hilo32.pio` - edge-timing measurement state machine (appears diagnostic/analysis tool)
