2026-05-15 13:30:42 [claude-haiku-4-5] Scratch Registers (X, Y)
2026-05-15 13:30:42 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:42 [claude-haiku-4-5] - 32-bit general purpose
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] - Loop counters: `set x, 15; ... jmp x-- loop`
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] - Conditional branching: `jmp !x skip` (branch if X=0)
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] - Temporary storage: Save/restore via MOV
