2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] FIFOs
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] Each SM has:
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] - TX FIFO (4 entries): System → SM (for data output)
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] - RX FIFO (4 entries): SM → system (for data input)
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] - DREQ signals: Drive DMA on FIFO activity
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] - FJOIN option: Merge into 8-entry single-direction FIFO
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] • New modes (RP2350):*
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] - FJOINRXGET: RX FIFO as indexed read-only storage
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] - FJOINRXPUT: RX FIFO as indexed write-only status
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] - FJOINRXPUTGET: Both (system access disabled)
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] 11.2.4 Stalling
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] State machine pauses when:
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] - WAIT condition not met
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] - PULL from empty TX FIFO (blocking)
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] - PUSH to full RX FIFO (blocking)
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] - OUT with autopull, OSR exhausted, TX FIFO empty
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] - IN with autopush, ISR full, RX FIFO full
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] - IRQ WAIT on set flag, waiting for clear
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] • Side-set exception:* Always executes, even during stall.
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] 11.2.5 Pin Mapping
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] PIO controls 30 GPIOs (RP2350) with 4 independent pin groups:
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] ╭───────────────┬─────────────────┬───────────────────────────────╮
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] │  Instruction  │  Pins Used      │  Config                       │
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] ├───────────────┼─────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┤
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] │  OUT PINS     │  OUT pins       │  OUT_BASE, OUT_COUNT          │
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] │  SET PINS     │  SET pins       │  SET_BASE, SET_COUNT          │
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] │  Side-set     │  Side-set pins  │  SIDESET_BASE, SIDESET_COUNT  │
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] │  IN PINS      │  IN pins        │  IN_BASE, IN_COUNT            │
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] ╰───────────────┴─────────────────┴───────────────────────────────╯
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] • Priority:* Highest-numbered SM wins on GPIO conflicts. Side-set overrides OUT/SET.
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] 11.2.6 IRQ Flags
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] • 8 total flags* (0-7), visible to all SMs.
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] - Set/clear: IRQ instruction
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] - Wait: WAIT IRQ instruction
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] - System routing: Lower 4 can trigger CPU interrupts
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] • Cross-PIO modes:*
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] - `irq set 0` → Local flag 0
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] - `irq next set 1` → Next higher PIO block, flag 1
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] - `irq prev set 2` → Next lower PIO block, flag 2
2026-05-15 13:30:43 [claude-haiku-4-5] - `irq set 0 rel` → Relative to SM number (SM2 + 0 → flag 2)
2026-05-15 13:30:44 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:44 [claude-haiku-4-5] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
