2026-05-15 13:30:44 [claude-haiku-4-5] │  **WAIT**           │  001                  │  Stall until GPIO/IRQ/PIN condition  │
2026-05-15 13:30:44 [claude-haiku-4-5] │  **IN**             │  010                  │  Shift bits into ISR                 │
