2026-05-15 13:30:45 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:45 [claude-haiku-4-5] • Destinations:*
2026-05-15 13:30:45 [claude-haiku-4-5] - `pins` – OUT-mapped GPIO pins
2026-05-15 13:30:45 [claude-haiku-4-5] - `x`, `y` – Scratch registers
2026-05-15 13:30:45 [claude-haiku-4-5] - `null` – Discard bits
2026-05-15 13:30:45 [claude-haiku-4-5] - `pindirs` – Output enable (direction) of OUT pins (RP2350 only)
