2026-05-15 13:30:46 [claude-haiku-4-5] 11.4.6 PUSH
2026-05-15 13:30:46 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:46 [claude-haiku-4-5] • Syntax:*
2026-05-15 13:30:46 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:46 [claude-haiku-4-5] push                      ; Always push ISR to RX FIFO
2026-05-15 13:30:46 [claude-haiku-4-5] push block                ; Stall if RX FIFO full
2026-05-15 13:30:46 [claude-haiku-4-5] push noblock              ; Discard if RX FIFO full
2026-05-15 13:30:46 [claude-haiku-4-5] push iffull               ; Only push if ISR count ≥ threshold
2026-05-15 13:30:46 [claude-haiku-4-5] push iffull block
2026-05-15 13:30:46 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:46 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:46 [claude-haiku-4-5] • Note:* Undefined if `FJOINRXPUT` or `FJOINRXGET` is set.
2026-05-15 13:30:46 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:46 [claude-haiku-4-5] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
