2026-05-15 13:30:46 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:46 [claude-haiku-4-5] pull                      ; Always pull TX FIFO to OSR
2026-05-15 13:30:46 [claude-haiku-4-5] pull block                ; Stall if TX FIFO empty
