2026-05-15 13:30:46 [claude-haiku-4-5] 11.4.10 MOV (General)
2026-05-15 13:30:46 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:46 [claude-haiku-4-5] • Syntax:*
2026-05-15 13:30:46 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:46 [claude-haiku-4-5] mov <dst>, (op) <src>
