2026-05-15 13:30:46 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:47 [claude-haiku-4-5] • Operations:*
2026-05-15 13:30:47 [claude-haiku-4-5] - (none) – Direct copy
2026-05-15 13:30:47 [claude-haiku-4-5] - `!` or `~` – Bitwise NOT
2026-05-15 13:30:47 [claude-haiku-4-5] - `::` – Bit reverse
2026-05-15 13:30:47 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:47 [claude-haiku-4-5] • Destinations:*
2026-05-15 13:30:47 [claude-haiku-4-5] - `pins`, `x`, `y` – As above
2026-05-15 13:30:47 [claude-haiku-4-5] - `pindirs` – Bulk direction control (RP2350 only)
2026-05-15 13:30:47 [claude-haiku-4-5] - `exec` – Execute as instruction
2026-05-15 13:30:47 [claude-haiku-4-5] - `pc` – Unconditional jump
2026-05-15 13:30:47 [claude-haiku-4-5] - `isr`, `osr` – Shift registers (clears shift counters)
2026-05-15 13:30:47 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:47 [claude-haiku-4-5] • Sources:*
2026-05-15 13:30:47 [claude-haiku-4-5] - `pins` – IN-mapped inputs (masked to IN_COUNT bits)
2026-05-15 13:30:47 [claude-haiku-4-5] - `x`, `y`, `null` – Registers / zeroes
2026-05-15 13:30:47 [claude-haiku-4-5] - `status` – All 1s or all 0s (configurable by EXECCTRLSTATUSSEL)
2026-05-15 13:30:47 [claude-haiku-4-5] - `isr`, `osr` – Shift registers
2026-05-15 13:30:47 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:47 [claude-haiku-4-5] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
