2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5] 11.5.4 Autopush and Autopull
2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5] • Autopull:* Refill OSR automatically when shift threshold reached.
2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5] .out 8 left auto 8        ; Auto-pull after 8 bits shifted out
