2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5] .program autopull_demo
2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5] .wrap_target
2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5]     out pins, 1 [1]       ; Shift 1 bit, clock low
2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5]     nop [1]               ; Delay, then...
2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5] .wrap                     ; Hardware auto-pulls if needed
2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5] • Autopush:* Push ISR automatically when shift threshold reached.
2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5] .in 8 right auto 8        ; Auto-push after 8 bits shifted in
2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
