2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5] .wrap_target
2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5]     in pins, 1 [1]        ; Shift 1 bit in
2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5]     nop [1]
2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5] .wrap                     ; Hardware auto-pushes if needed
