2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5] • Shift counters:*
2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5] - PULL / autopull clears OSR counter to 0
2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5] - PUSH / autopush clears ISR counter to 0
2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5] - MOV OSR/ISR clears respective counters
2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5] - OUT ISR, n sets ISR counter to n
2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:30:49 [claude-haiku-4-5] • Threshold:* 1-32 bits (0 encodes 32).
