2026-05-15 13:38:28 [claude-haiku-4-5] • Problem: All of `TeletextStateMachine`, `ColorPumpStateMachine`, and `ChromaStateMachine`
2026-05-15 13:38:28 [claude-haiku-4-5] are mapped to SM index `1`, but they're initialized in the `#ifdef` blocks. Only one can run at
2026-05-15 13:38:28 [claude-haiku-4-5] a time* because they'd share the same SM.
