2026-05-15 13:38:30 [claude-haiku-4-5] • Good practice.* The DMA channel is reconfigured per-field. However:
2026-05-15 13:38:30 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:38:30 [claude-haiku-4-5] - Timing assumption: `vidfieldi()` is called after the previous DMA transfer
2026-05-15 13:38:30 [claude-haiku-4-5] completes (checked by `!dmachannelisbusy()`).
2026-05-15 13:38:30 [claude-haiku-4-5] - Race condition potential: If frame update (drawFramei) is slow, you might miss the IRQ0
2026-05-15 13:38:30 [claude-haiku-4-5] trigger from vidbit that initiates line sync.
2026-05-15 13:38:30 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:38:30 [claude-haiku-4-5] • Recommendation:* Add a margin check:
2026-05-15 13:38:30 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:38:30 [claude-haiku-4-5] if (!dma_channel_is_busy(video_dma_chan)) {
2026-05-15 13:38:30 [claude-haiku-4-5]     // Draw frame (could take several ms)
2026-05-15 13:38:30 [claude-haiku-4-5]     drawFramei(field);
2026-05-15 13:38:30 [claude-haiku-4-5]     // Reconfigure DMA (very fast, ~μs)
2026-05-15 13:38:30 [claude-haiku-4-5]     vid_fieldi(field);
2026-05-15 13:38:30 [claude-haiku-4-5] }
2026-05-15 13:38:30 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:38:30 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:38:30 [claude-haiku-4-5] This ensures DMA is idle before reconfiguration.
2026-05-15 13:38:30 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:38:30 [claude-haiku-4-5] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
