2026-05-15 13:38:31 [claude-haiku-4-5] • Good for diagnostics. But consider what stalls mean:*
2026-05-15 13:38:31 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-15 13:38:31 [claude-haiku-4-5] - videoStall (vidbit on SM0): TX FIFO is empty (DMA hasn't fed data fast enough).
2026-05-15 13:38:31 [claude-haiku-4-5] - chromaStall: Same, but for chroma burst.
