2026-05-16 10:18:13 [claude-haiku-4-5] 4. Greyscale Mode (`greyline.pio`)
2026-05-16 10:18:13 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-16 10:18:13 [claude-haiku-4-5] mov osr, rxfifo[y]  ; y = pins[0..1] selects 1 of 4 6-bit patterns
2026-05-16 10:18:13 [claude-haiku-4-5] out pindirs, 1      ; (×6) Drive each bit onto tristate GPIO
