2026-05-17 09:04:57 [claude-haiku-4-5]  ꔀ nitrologic Relay 1.8.6 ⛲  claude-haiku-4-5 A\ 🪠 🧊 $0.003 8.941KB 3.21s
2026-05-17 09:04:57 [claude-haiku-4-5] `SPDRP_PORTNAME` is a device registry property identifier. The full name is:
2026-05-17 09:04:57 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-17 09:04:57 [claude-haiku-4-5] • SPDRP_PORTNAME* - Device Property: Port Name
2026-05-17 09:04:57 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-17 09:04:57 [claude-haiku-4-5] It's defined in `setupapi.h` and retrieves the COM port designation (e.g., "COM3", "COM15") from
2026-05-17 09:04:57 [claude-haiku-4-5] the device's registry properties.
2026-05-17 09:04:57 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-17 09:04:57 [claude-haiku-4-5] Other common SPDRP_* constants include:
2026-05-17 09:04:57 [claude-haiku-4-5] - `SPDRP_FRIENDLYNAME` - Human-readable device name
2026-05-17 09:04:57 [claude-haiku-4-5] - `SPDRP_DESCRIPTION` - Device description
2026-05-17 09:04:57 [claude-haiku-4-5] - `SPDRP_HARDWAREID` - Hardware ID string
2026-05-17 09:04:57 [claude-haiku-4-5] - `SPDRP_CLASS` - Device class
2026-05-17 09:04:57 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2026-05-17 09:04:57 [claude-haiku-4-5] These are part of the SetupAPI property identifiers for querying device registry data via
2026-05-17 09:04:57 [claude-haiku-4-5] `SetupDiGetDeviceRegistryProperty()`.
2026-05-17 09:04:57 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
