2026-05-18 15:45:12 [kimi-k2.6] through to `hi`. If you intended a timeout or pulse-width measurement, you probably want `set x,
2026-05-18 15:45:12 [kimi-k2.6] 31` (the largest immediate available to `SET`) or seed X from another register.
2026-05-18 15:45:12 [kimi-k2.6] 
