2026-05-18 15:45:12 [kimi-k2.6] work-in-progress, disregard; otherwise the assembler will likely reject it or it will run into the
2026-05-18 15:45:12 [kimi-k2.6] next instruction slot.
2026-05-18 15:45:12 [kimi-k2.6] 
