2026-05-18 15:45:13 [kimi-k2.6] in-band PIO teletext suggests you are pushing the hardware closer to its practical limits than most
2026-05-18 15:45:13 [kimi-k2.6] reference designs. If you want a second pair of eyes on a specific PIO timing calculation or the
