2026-05-18 19:00:29 [gemini-3.1-lite] 
2026-05-18 19:00:29 [gemini-3.1-lite]     if (pio0->fdebug & (1u << (PIO_FDEBUG_TXSTALL_LSB + VideoStateMachine))) {
