2026-05-18 19:00:29 [gemini-3.1-lite] 
2026-05-18 19:00:29 [gemini-3.1-lite] 4. DMA Configuration Mismatch
2026-05-18 19:00:29 [gemini-3.1-lite] Compare your `viddmainit` for both modes.
2026-05-18 19:00:29 [gemini-3.1-lite] • Progressive: You are using `progressiveWordCount`.
